<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The Pro page hero: the app as a Windows-10 mosaic. Eight tiles, and the gutter between them is
     the only separator — no borders around the picture. The four on the left are #111111 tiles with a
     hairline edge and a recessed glyph: what the free app already gives you. The four on the right are
     solid accent tiles carrying white glyphs: what Pro adds. The glyphs are the tour's 24-unit line art
     scaled 1.25x inside a tile, so a 1.2 stroke there lands as the same visual weight as the 1.5 the
     rest of the app draws with. Tiles are inset 1 unit so a stroke centred on the edge is not clipped. -->
